<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: SPORITELNA H1 NET DOWN 36 PCT - AGENCY.</title>
<headline>SPORITELNA H1 NET DOWN 36 PCT - AGENCY.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>First-half after-tax profit of the Czech savings bank Ceska Sporitelna a.s. fell to 803 million crowns from 1.291 billion for the same period last year, the Czech CTK news agency reported quoting filings with the Prague Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>Officials from the exchange nor Sporitelna were not immediately available for further comment.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
